{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Blender SpaceType Structure.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Blender SpaceType Structure.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"blender space type structure blender space type structure","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Blender SpaceType Structure.md","fileName":"Blender SpaceType Structure.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Blender SpaceType Structure","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-14 00:20\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Blender Editor Structure]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Blender Editor Structure","Blender Region Type Structure","Blender SpaceLink Structure","Blender Editor Registration","Blender Global Space Type Registry","coreblenderdevelopment.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Blender SpaceType Structure.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Blender SpaceType Structure.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"blender space type structure blender space type structure","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Blender SpaceType Structure.md","fileName":"Blender SpaceType Structure.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Blender SpaceType Structure","heading":"Blender SpaceType Structure","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"`SpaceType` is the runtime description of one Blender editor type. It records a unique identifier, menu name, icon, constructor and cleanup callbacks, other editor behaviors, an operator-registration callback, and a list of [[Blender Region Type Structure]] definitions.\n\nUnlike [[Blender SpaceLink Structure]], it is not persistent DNA because its function pointers describe runtime behavior. [[Blender Editor Registration]] populates one such record and places it in the [[Blender Global Space Type Registry]] so windows can create matching editor instances.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Blender Editor Str